       Label: {0} = total pod count (source + all groupable).
       Desc: {0} = same count. Spoken when a sighted player reads the gizmo.
       NoGroupable: disable reason when no adjacent launchers are found;
       reused by the "Select pods to group" gizmo. -->
  <RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Gizmo.GroupAllLabel>Tüm kullanılabilir kapsülleri grupla ({0})</RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Gizmo.GroupAllLabel>
  <RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Gizmo.GroupAllDesc>Kullanılabilir {0} taşıma kapsülünün tümünü seç ve yükleme penceresini aç.</RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Gizmo.GroupAllDesc>
  <RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Gizmo.SelectPodsLabel>Gruplanacak kapsülleri seç</RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Gizmo.SelectPodsLabel>
  <RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Gizmo.SelectPodsDesc>Hangi taşıma kapsüllerinin yükleme için birlikte gruplanacağını seçmek üzere kapsül seçim moduna gir.</RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Gizmo.SelectPodsDesc>
  <RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Gizmo.NoGroupable>Gruplanacak, fırlatıcısı bağlı başka taşıma kapsülü yok.</RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Gizmo.NoGroupable>

  <!-- Gizmo action results. {0} = pod count being grouped. -->
  <RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Gizmo.LoadCommandMissing>Yükleme komutu bulunamadı</RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Gizmo.LoadCommandMissing>
  <RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Gizmo.GroupingForLoading>Yükleme için {0} kapsül gruplanıyor</RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Gizmo.GroupingForLoading>

  <!-- Dialog lifecycle (Window_PostClose_LoadTransporters_Patch). Spoken when
       the user closes the loading dialog without pressing Accept. -->
  <RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Loading.Cancelled>Taşıma kapsülü yükleme işlemi iptal edildi</RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Loading.Cancelled>

  <!-- Visual keyboard-mode overlay (Dialog_LoadTransporters_DoWindowContents_Patch).
       Sighted-user indicator drawn in the top-left of the loading dialog so
       testers can tell keyboard mode is active. Localized for consistency. -->
  <RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Overlay.KeyboardModeActive>Klavye modu etkin</RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Overlay.KeyboardModeActive>
  <RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Overlay.InstructionsLine1>Sol/Sağ: Sekmeler | Yukarı/Aşağı: Öğeler | Enter/Boşluk: Miktar</RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Overlay.InstructionsLine1>
  <RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Overlay.InstructionsLine2>Tab: Ağırlık özeti | Alt+I: İncele | Alt+A: Kabul et | Esc: İptal et</RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Overlay.InstructionsLine2>

  <!-- Landing-spot targeting announcement (Targeter_BeginTargeting_Announce_Patch).
       Spoken once when the drop-pod landing targeter activates. -->
  <RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Landing.SelectLandingSpot>İniş noktasını seç. Gezinmek için ok tuşlarını, onaylamak için Boşluk tuşunu kullan.</RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Landing.SelectLandingSpot>

